      "text": "\"It had to be a level of urgency tonight for us. We had two days off, basically. We should be fresh.\" The Oilers gave up three goals in the final frame in a 4-2 loss to the Kraken on Friday. @paigymartin has your recap from @RogersPlace. @CIBC | #LetsGoOilers https://t.co/9PV48nuVc8",
